  "id": "intrusion-set--166ae14e-49aa-5972-bbcb-25b7ca464ad7",
  "name": "ShinyHunters",
  "description": "Reported independently by two AI vendors in the same cycle. Anthropic (GTG-50014): multiple ShinyHunters-affiliate operators decompiled 1.8M Android APKs via TruffleHog on a 10-node AWS EC2 fleet to scan for secrets; harvested GitHub PATs; reused stolen AI API keys for follow-on attacks; dumped 2,100+ Azure AD tokens across 40+ tenants in ~34 hours; compromised a SaaS supply-chain reaching ~200 downstream customers; ran a pay-or-leak extortion operation and a carding storefront (\"Soraki\") impersonating French national police branding. GTIG (UNC6240): used Claude-code prompts to write complex obfuscated code bypassing Cloudflare guardrails/perimeter defenses, and integrated Claude Code with custom MCP tools to parse and analyze exfiltrated directories for extortion targeting. Anthropic · GTIG",
